diff --git a/packages/client/ui-layout/README.md b/packages/client/ui-layout/README.md
index aa00242..934c6ad 100644
--- a/packages/client/ui-layout/README.md
+++ b/packages/client/ui-layout/README.md
@@ -90,0 +91,6 @@ None.
+
+## Pane keyboard navigation
+
+Press Ctrl+B, release, then press o / Shift+O to wrap forward / backward through every docked and floating pane group. Space cycles columns, rows and grid; % / double quote opens a picker to split the focused docked group right / below; z toggles focus; b toggles the sidebar. Escape, window blur and a two-second timeout cancel the prefix. Terminal and modal input remain local. The explicit prefix works in composers; Cmd+B remains the sidebar shortcut outside editing fields. Ctrl/Cmd+Alt+1/2/3/L remain direct layout shortcuts, matched by physical key code for macOS Option layouts.
+
+Split creation reuses the existing pane picker and workspace service. Choosing an existing pane moves it; it never clones a session. Reflow preserves all group/tab identities and floating geometry. No two-pane limit is imposed; usable simultaneous geometry remains bounded by the viewport.
